<section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap"><div class="head fx-up"><span class="kicker">FAQ</span><h2>Pricing questions, answered.</h2></div>
<div class="faq"><details><summary>Are these prices final?</summary><p>They are honest estimates for typical projects. After a short call about your goals and scope, you get a written proposal with a fixed price. Items marked &quot;from&quot; depend on scope.</p></details><details><summary>Do prices include GST?</summary><p>No. Prices are before GST, which is added at 18% for clients in India. Clients outside India are usually not charged GST on exported services.</p></details><details><summary>Can I pay in my own currency?</summary><p>Yes. Choose your currency at the top of the page to see estimates in it. Proposals and payment links can be issued in major currencies.</p></details><details><summary>What is a minimum term?</summary><p>Monthly plans such as SEO or social media need a few months to show results, so some have a minimum of 3 or 6 months. After that, you can stop with 30 days&#x27; notice.</p></details><details><summary>Can I combine services?</summary><p>Yes. Add plans from several services and any extras to build one custom plan. You get a single estimate, one point of contact and one invoice.</p></details><details><summary>How do I pay?</summary><p>By bank transfer, UPI, card or net banking through a secure Razorpay payment link sent with your proposal.</p></details></div></div></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Are these prices final?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "They are honest estimates for typical projects. After a short call about your goals and scope, you get a written proposal with a fixed price. Items marked \"from\" depend on scope."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do prices include GST?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Prices are before GST, which is added at 18% for clients in India. Clients outside India are usually not charged GST on exported services."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I pay in my own currency?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Choose your currency at the top of the page to see estimates in it. Proposals and payment links can be issued in major currencies."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is a minimum term?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Monthly plans such as SEO or social media need a few months to show results, so some have a minimum of 3 or 6 months. After that, you can stop with 30 days' notice."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I combine services?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Add plans from several services and any extras to build one custom plan. You get a single estimate, one point of contact and one invoice."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I pay?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "By bank transfer, UPI, card or net banking through a secure Razorpay payment link sent with your proposal."}}]}</script>
